This code defines a class `ESP8266Controller` that encapsulates the functionality of controlling an ESP8266 module over a serial UART connection. The class has methods for testing the connection, restarting the module, connecting to a Wi-Fi network, disconnecting from a Wi-Fi network, getting the IP address of the module, sending an HTTP request, and receiving an HTTP response.

